On Mon, Jan 7, 2013 at 4:17 AM, la gleki <gleki.is.my.name@gmail.com> wrote:

>
>
> On Monday, January 7, 2013 6:11:10 AM UTC+4, banseljaj wrote:
>>
>> Congratulations to everyone who showed up for a logfest well done. :)
>>
>
> xu do pu kacma vreji lo nu penmi
>
